WEBVTT

01:13.980 --> 01:19.300
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.500 --> 01:24.676
[Episode 17]

01:28.355 --> 01:29.305
Mr. Ma.

01:29.305 --> 01:31.105
President. Ma Is Yao here?

01:31.105 --> 01:32.355
He's in there. He didn't go anywhere.

01:32.355 --> 01:33.955
I'll let you crack on.

01:38.795 --> 01:41.825
Is he the Taoist living in the
yard who failed in his business?

01:41.825 --> 01:43.701
He is not a Taoist.

01:44.305 --> 01:45.635
He must be over 50 years old.

01:45.635 --> 01:47.275
He's 40. Ten years older than me.

01:47.275 --> 01:47.825
Really?

01:47.825 --> 01:49.105
He is that typical macho type of millionaire.

01:49.105 --> 01:50.825
He worked so hard that it made him look old.

01:50.825 --> 01:52.105
Let's go.

02:01.275 --> 02:03.465
The oranges need to be baked a little longer.

02:03.465 --> 02:05.005
Let's have tea first.

02:25.505 --> 02:27.189
Yao,

02:31.115 --> 02:35.943
the money you got in the Series A
funding round is far from enough.

02:37.745 --> 02:40.089
I think it's enough.

02:40.155 --> 02:41.815
You are doing business.

02:41.955 --> 02:43.955
It's normal they asked
you to contribute a portion

02:43.955 --> 02:46.515
so that you'll share the risk as well.

02:48.115 --> 02:50.267
If it goes on like this,

02:50.745 --> 02:53.425
I'll have to keep selling my apartments.

02:54.875 --> 02:57.207
Do you still have apartments?

02:57.305 --> 02:58.585
Didn't you sell all your apartments
and houses in Beijing

02:58.585 --> 03:00.185
to pay off your debts?

03:00.745 --> 03:02.825
The apartments in my hometown.

03:03.505 --> 03:05.505
In the first few years when I earned some money,

03:05.505 --> 03:06.505
I bought my parents two apartments

03:06.505 --> 03:09.605
on the same floor across the hall
in my hometown

03:09.835 --> 03:12.851
so that I could live close to them
when I go back,

03:12.875 --> 03:15.371
and it's more convenient
for me to take care of them.

03:15.395 --> 03:16.585
They were cheap back then.

03:16.585 --> 03:18.785
Now the price has gone up a lot.

03:19.675 --> 03:21.931
Then you have to think it through.

03:21.955 --> 03:24.305
I don't need to tell you the
risk of investing in a business.

03:24.305 --> 03:26.445
You know it better than anyone.

03:29.395 --> 03:30.675
I do.

03:31.585 --> 03:34.265
How should I talk to my parents about it

03:34.435 --> 03:36.515
without irritating them again?

03:38.235 --> 03:40.015
I need to think about it.

03:41.435 --> 03:44.595
When did you need to think before acting?

03:44.955 --> 03:47.095
How bold you were before.

03:47.235 --> 03:49.555
Your parents had saved most of their lives

03:49.555 --> 03:51.395
to buy you a small apartment in Beijing.

03:51.395 --> 03:52.345
But what did you do?

03:52.345 --> 03:54.626
You didn't even hesitate
when you took the money

03:54.626 --> 03:56.275
and started a business with your classmates.

03:56.275 --> 03:57.555
Well,

03:57.785 --> 04:00.115
a hero won't mention his past glories.

04:00.115 --> 04:01.435
At that time,

04:01.435 --> 04:02.995
I was like a newborn calve
that is not afraid of tigers.

04:02.995 --> 04:04.811
I was so fearless.

04:06.275 --> 04:08.619
I had good luck at that time.

04:08.835 --> 04:10.385
I made money no matter what business I did.

04:10.385 --> 04:13.725
I dared to tell my parents
only after I had earned money.

04:14.185 --> 04:15.761
But at that time,

04:15.945 --> 04:17.905
my parents were proud of me.

04:18.065 --> 04:20.681
All our relatives and neighbors knew it.

04:20.705 --> 04:25.017
The son of Ma's family
owned a big company in Beijing.

04:25.235 --> 04:26.115
They wanted my parents to pull some strings,

04:26.115 --> 04:30.667
asking me to find a job in
my company for their children.

04:30.825 --> 04:32.105
At that time...

04:35.505 --> 04:36.785
Later,

04:37.385 --> 04:38.865
I was done and out,

04:39.945 --> 04:42.385
so this group of people began to dish the dirt.

04:42.385 --> 04:43.865
Slanderous gossip.

04:46.065 --> 04:51.877
How hard it was for my
parents to hear about it.

04:55.385 --> 04:57.069
Mr. Ma,

04:58.115 --> 04:59.895
You are so different now.

05:00.435 --> 05:03.212
You began to consider
the feelings of your parents

05:03.675 --> 05:05.155
and also began to

05:05.475 --> 05:07.279
look before you leap.

05:08.355 --> 05:12.175
The limitless scenery can only be seen
at the perilous peak.

05:12.795 --> 05:15.505
But it is the high and mighty
who have the longest way to fall.

05:15.505 --> 05:18.425
I am the man who fell from the peak.

05:18.505 --> 05:19.785
It hurt.

05:20.625 --> 05:21.985
It made me scared.

05:23.355 --> 05:24.635
That means

05:24.945 --> 05:26.555
you are getting older.

05:26.555 --> 05:28.555
You used to be so young and reckless.

05:28.555 --> 05:29.675
If I didn't invest in your business,

05:29.675 --> 05:31.915
you would point at my nose and hurl abuse at me.

05:31.915 --> 05:33.945
How dare you do an investment
with such a lack of vision

05:33.945 --> 05:35.713
and decisiveness?

05:36.115 --> 05:37.505
Well, well, well.

05:37.505 --> 05:39.115
Don't slap me in the face.

05:39.115 --> 05:40.895
Leave some dignity to me.

05:41.185 --> 05:42.809
Who hasn't been

05:43.435 --> 05:46.487
young and reckless back then. Right?

05:46.555 --> 05:48.395
That's the price of youth.

06:04.945 --> 06:05.825
Wait a second.

06:05.825 --> 06:08.185
Granny, the piece
should be put right here.

06:08.185 --> 06:10.385
You haven't reached the end yet.

06:11.185 --> 06:12.875
I got 5 on my dice.

06:12.875 --> 06:14.625
I didn't move further.

06:14.625 --> 06:16.625
Granny, you got 4.

06:16.625 --> 06:18.825
No. It's 5.

06:18.825 --> 06:20.509
You got 4 on your dice.

06:21.065 --> 06:22.989
It's 5. I don't care.

06:23.065 --> 06:26.033
My plane has reached the end.

06:26.305 --> 06:28.945
Give me peanuts.

06:28.945 --> 06:30.235
We need to keep a close eye on it.

06:30.235 --> 06:31.625
Granny has known bad tricks.

06:31.625 --> 06:33.235
She learned from you.

06:33.235 --> 06:35.185
I really got it wrong in the last round.

06:35.185 --> 06:36.875
Be quick. Hurry.

06:36.875 --> 06:38.675
It's just a game.

06:38.675 --> 06:41.185
Don't be angry.

06:41.185 --> 06:42.725
One more time.

06:42.945 --> 06:44.225
One more.

06:54.065 --> 06:58.617
One, two, three, four. Strike.

06:59.675 --> 07:01.745
Granny, your plane was
struck back to the start again.

07:01.745 --> 07:04.881
Two of your planes was
struck back to the start.

07:04.995 --> 07:07.675
Granny, you're not angry, are you?

07:07.675 --> 07:09.945
Who just said, "It's just a game.

07:09.945 --> 07:12.541
"Don't be angry" just now?

07:14.625 --> 07:15.116
Granny. It hurts!

07:15.116 --> 07:18.323
It hurts.

07:18.675 --> 07:20.011
It's your turn.

07:27.675 --> 07:30.451
♫ Mung beans are delicious. ♫

07:30.475 --> 07:33.191
♫ Gingers are tender. ♫

07:33.215 --> 07:35.895
♫ Tender gingers taste pungent. ♫

07:35.895 --> 07:38.775
♫ They pile up like a tower, ♫

07:38.775 --> 07:41.775
♫ And the tower is tall. ♫

07:41.775 --> 07:44.435
♫ With a slim figure. ♫

07:44.435 --> 07:49.503
♫ My baby, let's go to sleep. ♫

07:52.875 --> 07:55.735
♫ And the tower is tall. ♫

07:55.735 --> 07:58.575
♫ With a slim figure. ♫

07:58.575 --> 08:05.575
♫ My baby, let's go to sleep. ♫

08:45.075 --> 08:46.355
Mr. Ma.

08:48.425 --> 08:51.995
I just wrote a song according
to Mr. Xie's father's preference.

08:51.995 --> 08:53.315
I just finished writing the score.

08:53.315 --> 08:54.875
I haven't had time to fill in the lyrics yet.

08:54.875 --> 08:57.545
You're the first one that I share the song with.

08:57.545 --> 08:58.825
Listen to it.

09:16.955 --> 09:17.665
What the hell.

09:17.665 --> 09:19.745
What the hell am I doing here?

09:21.745 --> 09:23.025
I have fallen.

09:25.995 --> 09:27.275
No.

09:28.075 --> 09:29.555
I need to calm down.

10:10.195 --> 10:11.475
No.

10:11.665 --> 10:13.145
I have to work hard.

10:38.195 --> 10:41.715
♫ Mountain to mountain, cliff to cliff ♫

10:41.715 --> 10:45.025
♫ Bees pick flowers from deep in the mountains ♫

10:45.025 --> 10:47.075
Hei. Jiahui.

10:47.075 --> 10:48.783
Hello.

10:52.475 --> 10:54.075
You have been working for just two days.

10:54.075 --> 10:56.755
Why do you sit down and slack off again,

10:56.955 --> 10:59.755
and scare people with your eyes wide open.

11:00.425 --> 11:02.835
Why do you laugh? What are you laughing at?

11:02.835 --> 11:04.459
I'm waiting for you.

11:04.665 --> 11:05.945
Waiting for me?

11:06.355 --> 11:07.643
Why?

11:07.905 --> 11:10.789
I would like to ask you something.

11:11.425 --> 11:12.773
Again.

11:13.475 --> 11:16.355
I told you that you
are a straight-A student

11:16.355 --> 11:18.475
but I'm merely an old woman
graduating from elementary school.

11:18.475 --> 11:19.835
What help can I offer you?

11:19.835 --> 11:21.145
No, you're wrong.

11:21.145 --> 11:23.165
You have great wisdom.

11:23.545 --> 11:25.025
Aunt Gui, come here.

11:25.195 --> 11:26.495
Please be seated.

11:29.025 --> 11:30.853
Okay, okay.

11:33.595 --> 11:38.451
Since you have kindly invited
me, I'll sit down and listen.

11:38.475 --> 11:42.295
Let's see if I can give you some advice.

11:42.425 --> 11:45.171
No rush. Have a cup of tea first.

11:45.195 --> 11:46.475
Thanks.

11:47.025 --> 11:48.325
Here's the thing.

11:49.785 --> 11:51.065
As you know,

11:51.195 --> 11:54.391
I'm starting up a business.

11:54.425 --> 11:55.705
Of course,

11:55.785 --> 11:58.345
This is not my first business venture.

11:59.665 --> 12:02.051
My first few business ventures

12:02.075 --> 12:06.299
can be said to be smooth
and quite successful.

12:06.315 --> 12:09.331
I almost reached the peak of my career.

12:10.425 --> 12:14.661
However, In the middle
of my last venture,

12:14.665 --> 12:17.241
I failed to predict

12:17.265 --> 12:19.045
the changes in the market

12:19.195 --> 12:20.555
and went bankrupt.

12:21.835 --> 12:27.491
After that, I carefully summarized
my previous successes,

12:28.075 --> 12:31.521
and I found that
luck had played a more important role.

12:31.545 --> 12:36.769
As you know, nine out
of ten business ventures

12:37.075 --> 12:38.675
are doomed to failure.

12:39.195 --> 12:43.267
Failure is much more than success.

12:43.425 --> 12:48.085
The last one who can go to
the top is the best in the industry.

12:49.785 --> 12:51.065
But

12:51.315 --> 12:53.425
of course, I do think that
what you taught me previously

12:53.425 --> 12:56.453
is quite right.

12:56.545 --> 12:59.345
I must take my parents into consideration.

13:00.025 --> 13:01.649
My parents

13:01.835 --> 13:03.135
are very old now.

13:03.425 --> 13:08.425
If I fail again in this
venture, it will come as

13:08.425 --> 13:10.397
a terrible blow to them.

13:11.595 --> 13:14.995
That's where my concern lies.

13:15.075 --> 13:17.835
So I would like to hear your opinion.

13:17.835 --> 13:20.563
Should I

13:20.995 --> 13:22.655
start a business again?

13:24.355 --> 13:25.635
Mr. Ma.

13:26.265 --> 13:28.861
What you said

13:29.145 --> 13:30.829
is nonsense.

13:31.905 --> 13:35.545
Didn't you just say that
you are already in business?

13:35.545 --> 13:38.475
If you are starting a business,
why are you asking me

13:38.475 --> 13:39.715
if you should start a business?

13:39.715 --> 13:41.075
Isn't it nonsense?

13:43.145 --> 13:43.545
Right.

13:43.545 --> 13:46.355
I didn't make myself clear.

13:46.355 --> 13:47.655
Let me ask again.

13:49.195 --> 13:52.787
Should I still continue to start a business?

13:52.955 --> 13:56.195
You're asking me if you
should give up halfway through.

13:56.195 --> 13:57.475
Right?

14:01.785 --> 14:03.065
Okay.

14:03.785 --> 14:06.465
Even if you give up halfway through now,

14:06.665 --> 14:08.745
what are you going to do next?

14:08.955 --> 14:12.043
Sitting here and meditating all day?

14:12.835 --> 14:14.315
Seeing you like this

14:14.545 --> 14:16.997
will not be a terrible
blow to your parents?

14:18.785 --> 14:20.785
Meditation is irrelevant to this.

14:20.785 --> 14:22.925
As Sutra of Pure and Calm goes,

14:23.265 --> 14:25.195
If one can always keep a clear and pure mind,

14:25.195 --> 14:27.025
then even heaven and earth
will be subsumed in your nature.

14:27.025 --> 14:29.905
Don't recite the sutra to me.

14:29.905 --> 14:31.145
Let me ask you.

14:31.145 --> 14:33.521
you have cleared your own mind,

14:33.545 --> 14:35.475
but have you thought about your parents?

14:35.475 --> 14:38.025
Although they won't blame you,
what will they think in their hearts?

14:38.025 --> 14:39.425
Won't they be sad?

14:39.425 --> 14:41.541
Won't they be upset?

14:41.955 --> 14:43.545
Here's what I think.

14:43.545 --> 14:47.025
In my opinion, you might as
well fight for your career again.

14:47.025 --> 14:47.836
Do something.

14:47.836 --> 14:49.545
Carve out your own career.

14:49.545 --> 14:51.475
In this way, Your parents
will not be worried about

14:51.475 --> 14:53.675
you becoming a monk.

14:59.425 --> 15:04.835
When thinking of your parents,
you must put yourself in their shoes.

15:04.835 --> 15:06.115
Understand?

15:08.715 --> 15:14.791
How can I put myself in their shoes?

15:23.025 --> 15:25.955
I have two children.

15:25.955 --> 15:27.235
You know it.

15:30.475 --> 15:31.895
My daughter Xi

15:32.835 --> 15:36.761
has been close to me since little.

15:36.785 --> 15:39.033
She always ran around me

15:39.195 --> 15:43.075
like a little puppy, calling "Mom! Mom!".

15:43.425 --> 15:45.445
When she was still at school,

15:45.955 --> 15:48.545
she would tell me about
what happened at school,

15:48.545 --> 15:51.545
what lessons the teacher taught them,

15:51.545 --> 15:54.835
which classmate's home they
went to play at, and whatever

15:54.835 --> 15:57.803
every day after she came home.

15:59.315 --> 16:01.595
Yang is a boy.

16:01.595 --> 16:03.075
He didn't talk much,

16:03.355 --> 16:07.559
but whenever you asked him
he would tell you all about it.

16:08.425 --> 16:10.925
So when the two children were little,

16:11.075 --> 16:14.319
their father and I
were seldom worried about them.

16:15.025 --> 16:19.075
Because no matter what happened
they would not hide from us.

16:19.075 --> 16:20.411
Definitely.

16:24.145 --> 16:25.805
But now it's different.

16:27.475 --> 16:29.075
They've both grown up.

16:29.665 --> 16:34.325
They have their own families and kids.

16:35.595 --> 16:39.475
And they live far away from us.

16:40.025 --> 16:44.733
So making phone calls is the
way we communicate on daily basis.

16:44.955 --> 16:47.761
And every time I call
them, I can ask nothing but

16:47.785 --> 16:49.325
"How have you been?"

16:49.355 --> 16:50.835
"Have you eaten?"

16:51.075 --> 16:52.665
"How's your work?"

16:52.665 --> 16:54.865
"How's your physical condition?"

16:55.075 --> 16:56.315
"How's the weather?"

16:56.315 --> 16:57.855
"Are there typhoons?"

16:59.835 --> 17:01.675
And they will only answer,

17:02.075 --> 17:03.835
"We have eaten."

17:03.835 --> 17:04.666
"Our work is fine."

17:04.666 --> 17:06.075
"We have been doing good."

17:06.075 --> 17:09.425
Anyway, we both tell each other
the good news, not the bad news.

17:09.425 --> 17:10.705
Usual greetings.

17:11.075 --> 17:12.355
Yes.

17:13.185 --> 17:14.465
The same.

17:16.945 --> 17:20.069
My parents asked me the same thing.

17:21.355 --> 17:22.595
If you don't talk about these trivial matters,

17:22.595 --> 17:24.615
what else can you talk about?

17:27.355 --> 17:28.787
To be honest,

17:28.835 --> 17:34.335
Even if they tell us about
their work, we can't understand.

17:35.075 --> 17:40.595
If young couples like them
have a fight, if their kids are sick,

17:40.595 --> 17:43.647
or if there is something unhappy,

17:43.945 --> 17:45.713
they will never tell us

17:46.145 --> 17:48.555
because they are afraid that we will be worried.

17:48.555 --> 17:51.665
And we also know that
they have a lot of pressure.

17:51.665 --> 17:53.811
It's hard for you to make money.

17:53.835 --> 17:55.905
We don't want to add to their burden.

17:55.905 --> 18:01.129
So we always told them that
we have been great as well.

18:01.945 --> 18:04.205
There was nothing serious anyway.

18:04.945 --> 18:09.075
Once Yang had a bad cold.

18:09.075 --> 18:12.921
He was so seriously ill that
he was hospitalized in the ICU.

18:12.945 --> 18:14.315
But we didn't even know it.

18:14.315 --> 18:15.555
Then the Spring Festival came,

18:15.555 --> 18:17.035
and they came home to
celebrate the Lunar New Year.

18:17.035 --> 18:19.271
Xi spilled the beans.

18:20.905 --> 18:25.589
I was so pissed off that the
whole New Year holiday was ruined.

18:27.665 --> 18:28.945
Think about it.

18:30.225 --> 18:32.725
Such a cold can nearly kill a person

18:33.275 --> 18:35.225
and make him admitted to the ICU.

18:35.225 --> 18:41.505
So if something really happens,
how much regret do you have to leave?

18:44.905 --> 18:46.205
Mr. Ma,

18:47.075 --> 18:48.927
look at you.

18:49.225 --> 18:52.625
When you are talking sense into
others, you are so clear-minded

18:52.625 --> 18:54.261
and sensible.

18:54.355 --> 18:58.715
But when it comes to yourself,
why do you become confused?

19:02.555 --> 19:06.291
Don't shoulder everything on your own.

19:06.315 --> 19:10.705
You need to communicate with
your family, especially your parents.

19:10.705 --> 19:12.555
You need to talk to them.

19:12.555 --> 19:15.859
You need to learn to give and take.

19:16.315 --> 19:19.955
You're not a teapot without a spout.

19:22.905 --> 19:25.331
My children Xi and Yang

19:25.355 --> 19:30.471
are very filial. That's good.

19:31.905 --> 19:36.075
Yang just called me the other
day, asking me and his dad

19:36.075 --> 19:38.935
to go to Qingdao and stay for half a month.

19:38.985 --> 19:42.013
The apartment that Yang bought is large.

19:42.315 --> 19:43.595
It has been a year
since the interior decoration was finished.

19:43.595 --> 19:46.035
We haven't been to his new home yet.

19:46.315 --> 19:47.975
Xi also said that...

19:48.775 --> 19:51.415
♫ What can I do? ♫

19:51.415 --> 19:56.495
♫ I have piles of mung beans. ♫

20:00.025 --> 20:02.775
♫ Mung beans are delicious. ♫

20:02.775 --> 20:05.615
♫ Gingers are tender. ♫

20:05.615 --> 20:08.295
♫ Tender gingers taste pungent. ♫

20:08.295 --> 20:11.295
♫ They pile up like a tower, ♫

20:11.295 --> 20:14.055
♫ And the tower is tall. ♫

20:14.055 --> 20:16.975
♫ With a slim figure. ♫

20:16.975 --> 20:22.007
♫ My baby, let's go to sleep. ♫

20:26.835 --> 20:28.315
Let me ask you a question.

20:28.315 --> 20:30.075
Guess what materials are used to make the dyes

20:30.075 --> 20:31.795
in these three dye vats.

20:32.115 --> 20:33.625
I heard they're made of Banlangen.

20:33.625 --> 20:34.835
Exactly.

20:34.835 --> 20:37.355
They are made from
fermented Banlangen and lime

20:37.355 --> 20:38.385
so that the color does not fall off easily.

20:38.385 --> 20:39.555
Look at this craftsman.

20:39.555 --> 20:41.225
He is rubbing the cloth.

20:41.225 --> 20:42.115
Actually,

20:42.115 --> 20:44.075
he is dying the cloth in the uniform color
like the cloth you see in the back.

20:44.075 --> 20:45.075
And the master here

20:45.075 --> 20:46.465
is dying the cloth
into a gradually lightened color.

20:46.465 --> 20:46.876
Look at it.

20:46.876 --> 20:48.385
It has been divided into three phases.

20:48.385 --> 20:52.421
And the color becomes lighter
and lighter gradually and slowly.

20:53.495 --> 20:56.515
♫ What can I do? ♫

20:56.515 --> 21:01.379
♫ I have piles of mung beans. ♫

21:04.875 --> 21:07.775
♫ Mung beans are delicious. ♫

21:07.775 --> 21:10.415
♫ Gingers are tender. ♫

21:10.415 --> 21:13.391
♫ Tender gingers taste pungent. ♫

21:13.415 --> 21:16.075
♫ They pile up like a tower, ♫

21:16.075 --> 21:18.815
♫ And the tower is tall. ♫

21:18.815 --> 21:21.875
♫ With a slim figure. ♫

21:21.875 --> 21:27.267
♫ My baby, let's go to sleep. ♫

21:27.875 --> 21:29.385
She hid quietly behind the kitchen and said

21:29.385 --> 21:31.345
"You jerk. You're a wanton."

21:31.555 --> 21:32.555
Bravo.

21:32.555 --> 21:34.035
That's hilarious.

21:34.035 --> 21:34.905
Look.

21:34.905 --> 21:38.257
Yang Guanjun was pole dancing on a tree.

21:46.985 --> 21:49.595
Have you ever written a script?

21:49.595 --> 21:51.603
Nope. It's my first time.

21:51.835 --> 21:53.075
It's hard, isn't it?

21:53.075 --> 21:54.115
Not too hard.

21:54.115 --> 21:55.755
When I think it is the people
we know who are going to act,

21:55.755 --> 21:57.235
I am so inspired.

21:57.275 --> 21:59.985
I have to say that I think it's so funny.

21:59.985 --> 22:01.315
It is!

22:01.315 --> 22:02.705
When I was watching
TV, I can't help but wonder

22:02.705 --> 22:03.516
what the scriptwriter was writing.

22:03.516 --> 22:05.315
I think I can be a scriptwriter.

22:05.315 --> 22:09.835
Then, do you think there is
anything that you are not satisfied with

22:09.835 --> 22:11.115
in this writing?

22:11.835 --> 22:13.975
I am 100% satisfied so far.

22:14.275 --> 22:15.755
Let me put it this way.

22:15.755 --> 22:17.595
I think my writing is so coherent
from the beginning to the end.

22:17.595 --> 22:18.595
What do you think?

22:18.595 --> 22:19.979
I think

22:20.555 --> 22:22.515
it can't be called a script.

22:24.115 --> 22:25.395
Indeed.

22:25.795 --> 22:29.567
I created this script in
the way I write a novel.

22:29.705 --> 22:31.629
You call it a novel?

22:32.835 --> 22:36.795
I know a novel needs to have a
complete story But what we are doing

22:36.795 --> 22:38.275
is a promotional video after all.

22:38.275 --> 22:42.336
So I have deliberately
added a lot of funny stuff to it.

22:42.705 --> 22:44.115
Funny stuff?

22:44.115 --> 22:45.395
For example?

22:46.385 --> 22:47.733
For example.

22:50.035 --> 22:50.556
For example.

22:50.556 --> 22:51.465
You laughed so happily just now.

22:51.465 --> 22:53.705
Tell her what you were laughing at.

22:53.705 --> 22:54.985
So

22:55.465 --> 22:58.795
Huang Xinxin was scared by the dog at the beach.

22:58.795 --> 23:02.811
Hulu, Tuotuo, Huzi, and
Guobao stood up to protect her.

23:02.835 --> 23:05.385
The four kids didn't defeat the dog.

23:05.385 --> 23:09.553
The five of them were
chased by the dog, crying.

23:10.315 --> 23:14.625
It's like... It is more
about using a running shot

23:14.625 --> 23:18.301
to show the audience the
coastal scenery of our village.

23:18.835 --> 23:20.115
And here.

23:24.465 --> 23:29.795
Xu Hongdou was in Youfeng Yard,
laughing while she was riding a bike.

23:29.795 --> 23:32.985
Meanwhile, Nana was spraying water at her
with a hose for watering flowers

23:32.985 --> 23:35.149
Under the shining sun,

23:35.355 --> 23:38.905
Xu Hongdou was smiling,
as beautiful as the rainbow.

23:38.905 --> 23:41.625
Hongdou, this is not for fun.

23:41.625 --> 23:45.315
This is more to reflect a
kind of ultimate romance

23:45.315 --> 23:48.091
and the vibe of friendship among people.

23:48.115 --> 23:50.875
The ending is the most hilarious.

23:50.875 --> 23:55.035
Xie Zhiyao grabbed a
flag from the villagers.

23:55.035 --> 23:59.905
He rode his horse across the sea
and mountains and planted a flag

23:59.905 --> 24:03.625
flying in the wind which
read Welcome to Yunmiao

24:03.625 --> 24:07.085
at the highest point
overlooking Yunmiao village,

24:07.835 --> 24:09.836
Actually, the function of this plot
is that the audience does not know

24:09.836 --> 24:14.003
what he actually grabbed so as to trigger

24:14.225 --> 24:15.385
a kind of suspense.

24:15.385 --> 24:16.829
Suspense.

24:19.315 --> 24:21.083
It's so funny, isn't it?

24:21.875 --> 24:23.075
So funny.

24:23.075 --> 24:24.755
I laughed so hard that
I got a runny nose.

24:24.755 --> 24:26.703
I can't stop laughing.

24:44.465 --> 24:45.315
It's for you.

24:45.315 --> 24:46.595
For me?

24:47.035 --> 24:48.803
So cute!

24:49.115 --> 24:49.755
Thanks.

24:49.755 --> 24:51.035
And more!

24:56.315 --> 24:57.595
Damai.

24:59.385 --> 25:00.829
Come here.

25:01.465 --> 25:02.745
Go.

25:43.075 --> 25:45.023
Who wrote the script?

25:46.315 --> 25:49.044
It's written by someone
you don't know very well.

25:49.625 --> 25:51.165
I admire the courage.

25:52.145 --> 25:56.035
Damai, Don't you think
there is a little bit of merit in it?

25:56.035 --> 25:57.315
A little bit.

25:57.315 --> 25:58.595
What is it?

25:58.595 --> 26:00.603
I just said courage.

26:05.755 --> 26:07.315
Do you know how to write?

26:07.315 --> 26:08.385
I don't.

26:08.385 --> 26:10.225
But you're a novel writer.

26:10.465 --> 26:11.595
Novels are novels.

26:11.595 --> 26:12.356
Scripts are scripts.

26:12.356 --> 26:13.835
They belong to different industries.

26:13.835 --> 26:15.755
Then can you step into
script writing for a while

26:15.755 --> 26:18.915
and help us write a script
for our promotional film.

26:19.355 --> 26:20.315
You can get paid.

26:20.315 --> 26:22.555
I won't do it even if I can get paid.

26:22.555 --> 26:25.625
I can not stand the suffering
of being a scriptwriter.

26:25.625 --> 26:26.555
Suffering?

26:26.555 --> 26:27.835
What suffering?

26:29.555 --> 26:31.595
The suffering of your script

26:31.595 --> 26:34.385
that take you several days and nights to write

26:34.385 --> 26:37.785
being criticized randomly
by people irrelevant.

26:41.355 --> 26:44.755
As a novel writer,
won't you suffer from the readers?

26:47.075 --> 26:49.491
Some readers will criticize my work,

26:49.515 --> 26:52.735
but there's no middleman
to pocket the difference.

26:53.985 --> 26:55.275
Nice talk, Damai.

26:55.275 --> 26:56.075
Nice to meet you.

26:56.075 --> 26:57.375
My name is Sunzi.

27:11.465 --> 27:12.275
Thank you.

27:12.275 --> 27:12.905
You're welcome.

27:12.905 --> 27:14.035
Thank you.

27:14.035 --> 27:15.315
Please enjoy.

27:17.835 --> 27:19.075
Morning, Nana.

27:19.075 --> 27:20.145
Morning, Sunzi.

27:20.145 --> 27:22.075
What would you like to eat today?

27:22.075 --> 27:26.385
A pot of white tea and
spicy potato patties with beef.

27:26.385 --> 27:27.665
Got it.

27:28.315 --> 27:30.315
Why are you on your own today?

27:30.315 --> 27:33.079
There aren't many people in
the store today so I'm on my own.

27:34.275 --> 27:35.555
By the way?

27:35.555 --> 27:36.985
How's your script?

27:36.985 --> 27:38.465
Still working on it.

27:39.875 --> 27:41.115
I'll sit inside.

27:41.115 --> 27:41.625
Sure.

27:41.625 --> 27:42.985
I'll bring your food to you later.

27:42.985 --> 27:43.515
Granny.

27:43.515 --> 27:44.385
Good morning.

27:44.385 --> 27:45.555
Junzi is here.

27:45.555 --> 27:47.835
Granny, my name is Sunzi.

27:47.835 --> 27:49.399
Sunzi.

27:49.595 --> 27:50.625
Yes!

27:50.625 --> 27:51.985
Sunzi.

27:51.985 --> 27:53.225
I'm going inside.

27:53.225 --> 27:54.505
Sure.

27:55.225 --> 27:56.525
Sunzi.

27:56.905 --> 27:58.185
Junzi.

28:00.555 --> 28:01.835
Damai.

28:02.115 --> 28:03.395
Morning.

28:03.755 --> 28:05.035
Morning.

28:20.385 --> 28:22.585
Seaside.

28:29.835 --> 28:31.115
Damai,

28:31.225 --> 28:34.315
what do you think of the
scene of children chasing

28:34.315 --> 28:36.361
and catching insects
with nets on the beach?

28:36.385 --> 28:38.076
I heard Mr. Xie said they
often went to the beach

28:38.076 --> 28:39.835
to catch dragonflies when they were young.

28:39.835 --> 28:42.075
And there is a tree in
the middle of the water

28:42.075 --> 28:45.475
which will look beautiful
if we take a picture of it.

28:46.315 --> 28:47.795
That would be great.

28:47.795 --> 28:49.875
Thank you for the recognition.

28:50.555 --> 28:51.835
However,

28:52.555 --> 28:55.571
there might be some
potential safety hazards.

28:55.835 --> 28:59.881
Parents won't let their
children play at the river.

28:59.905 --> 29:03.125
It must be even more dangerous
to play by the sea.

29:05.225 --> 29:06.813
It's just my opinion.

29:07.225 --> 29:09.555
Many readers are very
concerned about this issue,

29:09.555 --> 29:10.906
thinking that you're promoting
something dangerous.

29:10.906 --> 29:13.275
So we need to pay extra
attention to it while creating.

29:13.275 --> 29:15.316
If you have to add this
sentence, I suggest that

29:15.316 --> 29:17.555
you specify in the author's message

29:17.555 --> 29:18.625
that "it is dangerous for children
to play at the beach.

29:18.625 --> 29:19.555
Please don't imitate at will."

29:19.555 --> 29:21.035
Something like this.

29:21.075 --> 29:22.795
It's so strict.

29:24.315 --> 29:26.035
Thanks for the reminder.

29:34.555 --> 29:36.995
Damai, sorry to interrupt you again.

29:37.115 --> 29:37.985
I saw someone playing

29:37.985 --> 29:39.355
the Longtou Sanxian (a plucked string instrument
with a dragon headstock and three strings)

29:39.355 --> 29:42.275
when I was strolling in the
square I really enjoyed the vibe.

29:42.275 --> 29:45.663
I think we can add a bit of drama here.

29:46.275 --> 29:47.315
Romance?

29:47.315 --> 29:48.385
Yes.

29:48.385 --> 29:51.505
Don't people here do
Antiphonal Singing on March 3rd?

29:51.515 --> 29:53.625
I'll tell you my opinion.

29:53.625 --> 29:54.355
See?

29:54.355 --> 29:57.225
We have written a lot
in the previous plots.

29:57.225 --> 29:58.993
But look at here.

29:59.275 --> 30:01.955
We can add something more...

30:39.355 --> 30:40.425
Hello.

30:40.425 --> 30:41.705
Hello.

30:41.795 --> 30:44.811
Villagers of Yunmiao
Village, attention please!

30:44.835 --> 30:47.315
We recently will shoot a
promotional video in the village,

30:47.315 --> 30:49.075
so we need extras.

30:49.075 --> 30:51.881
If you can sing and
dance well, please apply!

30:51.905 --> 30:55.121
A great opportunity to
showcase your charisma.

30:55.145 --> 30:55.906
Join us!

30:55.906 --> 30:58.466
Apply at the village committee office.

31:00.555 --> 31:02.035
Turn around.

31:05.555 --> 31:07.119
Very good!

31:07.555 --> 31:08.875
You have great potential.

31:08.875 --> 31:10.931
Come on, tell us your dream.

31:12.835 --> 31:14.115
Huang,

31:14.555 --> 31:15.975
don't be like this.

31:16.315 --> 31:17.795
I'm a little scared.

31:21.555 --> 31:24.355
We have been waiting for two
hours, how come no one came?

31:24.355 --> 31:26.459
Where is everyone?

31:26.875 --> 31:28.883
Maybe they're all occupied.

31:30.115 --> 31:30.835
No rush.

31:30.835 --> 31:33.275
We can do the scenery shot first anyway.

31:33.275 --> 31:34.705
It's a beautiful day today.

31:34.705 --> 31:37.385
We can do a sunset
shot later in the afternoon.

31:42.075 --> 31:43.843
It's noon now.

31:44.075 --> 31:46.051
What about having lunch first?

31:46.075 --> 31:47.355
Okay.

31:47.985 --> 31:48.625
Sure.

31:48.625 --> 31:50.875
Galsang Flower Restaurant. My treat.

31:50.875 --> 31:52.155
Let's go.

31:54.555 --> 31:55.835
Xinxin.

31:56.465 --> 31:57.813
Candy.

31:58.385 --> 31:59.555
Can I sign up?

31:59.555 --> 32:00.595
Absolutely!

32:00.595 --> 32:01.555
How about a few more people?

32:01.555 --> 32:02.035
No problem.

32:02.035 --> 32:02.836
Come in.

32:02.836 --> 32:04.363
Come inside.

32:05.835 --> 32:07.115
Hello,

32:07.795 --> 32:09.611
they're all my friends.

32:10.755 --> 32:12.035
Hello.

32:26.465 --> 32:27.186
Sunzi went to shoot the sunset scene

32:27.186 --> 32:29.225
on the mountain with the assistant.

32:29.225 --> 32:31.441
They might be caught in the rain.

32:31.465 --> 32:33.875
I am afraid that
the machine will be damaged by rain.

32:33.875 --> 32:35.391
It's expensive.

32:38.145 --> 32:39.465
The machine is alright.

32:39.465 --> 32:41.555
When they saw the weather was
getting worse, they came back.

32:41.555 --> 32:43.995
They are at Huang Xinxin's home now.

32:44.595 --> 32:46.275
Did Junzi tell you this?

32:46.275 --> 32:47.315
Sunzi.

32:47.315 --> 32:48.145
Sorry.

32:48.145 --> 32:49.425
Sunzi.

32:50.555 --> 32:53.035
Since when are you
so familiar with Sunzi?

32:53.275 --> 32:57.971
Sunzi asked me to help come
up with some ideas with her.

32:58.225 --> 32:59.945
Why are you so obliging?

33:02.225 --> 33:04.731
I was lured into the cage by her,

33:04.755 --> 33:06.991
getting involved in
this stuff unconsciously.

33:07.555 --> 33:10.595
What do you mean by "was lured into the cage"?

33:11.075 --> 33:14.315
I was led by the nose.

33:14.315 --> 33:18.465
But the way Sunzi talks
makes people feel comfortable

33:18.465 --> 33:21.805
so that you're willing to
be led by the nose by her.

33:36.755 --> 33:38.175
Uncle Qingze,

33:42.355 --> 33:42.985
Don't worry.

33:42.985 --> 33:43.556
I'll be right over.

33:43.556 --> 33:45.036
Okay. See you later.

33:45.705 --> 33:46.355
What's wrong?

33:46.355 --> 33:47.555
The pony was missing.

33:47.555 --> 33:48.985
The one which you watched
deliver the baby last time.

33:48.985 --> 33:50.315
I need to look for it.

33:50.315 --> 33:51.035
I'll go with you.

33:51.035 --> 33:51.596
Don't come with me.

33:51.596 --> 33:52.905
It's raining. Stay here.

33:52.905 --> 33:54.745
Let me borrow an umbrella.

33:56.075 --> 33:56.795
The umbrella is useless.

33:56.795 --> 33:58.095
Wear my raincoat.

34:18.545 --> 34:21.585
It followed other
horses into other stables.

34:21.585 --> 34:24.835
I was also looking for it but a
large horse blocked my view,

34:24.835 --> 34:26.255
so I didn't see it.

34:27.315 --> 34:30.585
It's my fault that I didn't make
things clear before I called you.

34:30.585 --> 34:32.545
No problem. As long as you found it.

34:32.545 --> 34:33.905
Yes. You're right.

34:33.985 --> 34:35.405
You must be frozen!

34:35.905 --> 34:37.155
I... I've made a fire in my office.

34:37.155 --> 34:39.385
You two go warm yourself
and drink some warm water.

34:39.385 --> 34:40.105
Don't catch a cold.

34:40.105 --> 34:40.635
Hurry.

34:40.635 --> 34:41.355
Okay.

34:41.355 --> 34:42.235
It's nothing.

34:42.235 --> 34:42.905
I'm truly sorry.

34:42.905 --> 34:43.545
It's okay.

34:43.545 --> 34:46.178
I'll take you upstairs
to dry your hair first.

34:48.355 --> 34:50.065
The pony wasn't missing.

34:50.065 --> 34:51.929
but you almost got lost.

34:52.315 --> 34:54.545
I told you not to go too far, didn't I?

34:54.545 --> 34:56.985
And why did you lend your raincoat
to other people?

34:56.985 --> 34:59.481
I met a tourist who was with kids.

34:59.505 --> 35:00.795
They were stuck there.

35:00.795 --> 35:03.355
Why did you give away the umbrella as well?

35:03.355 --> 35:04.635
Two kids.

35:06.635 --> 35:08.115
Fine.

35:08.755 --> 35:09.755
Come closer.

35:09.755 --> 35:10.546
Dry yourself first.

35:10.546 --> 35:11.966
Don't catch a cold.

35:16.545 --> 35:19.525
Why is it raining so heavily all of a sudden?

35:19.585 --> 35:20.921
Raining is good.

35:21.065 --> 35:23.131
Mushrooms grow after the rain.

35:23.155 --> 35:25.355
Don't you like to eat mushrooms?

35:26.545 --> 35:27.715
You must be hungry.

35:27.715 --> 35:29.065
Here, have some roasted sweet potatoes.

35:29.065 --> 35:29.546
Thank you.

35:29.546 --> 35:30.795
Thank you Uncle Zeqing.

35:30.795 --> 35:32.025
Don't be a stranger.

35:32.025 --> 35:33.155
Eat before it cools down.

35:33.155 --> 35:34.435
Okay.

35:35.505 --> 35:36.785
It's hot!

35:37.635 --> 35:38.915
Eat slowly.

35:40.195 --> 35:42.215
It just came out of the oven.

35:44.835 --> 35:46.399
Eat half of it first.

35:54.835 --> 35:56.195
Why don't you eat?

35:56.875 --> 35:58.155
Thank you.

35:58.675 --> 35:59.955
You're welcome.

36:01.425 --> 36:04.105
Usually, I'm the one who takes care of others.

36:04.105 --> 36:05.385
You're touched?

36:05.635 --> 36:07.439
Not necessarily.

36:08.025 --> 36:12.155
When I take care of others, I
don't see others moved so much.

36:12.155 --> 36:14.355
They usually just say thank you.

36:14.385 --> 36:17.653
Shouldn't you answer, "I'm
touched" at such a time?

36:18.905 --> 36:22.989
You already have the answer in
your mind before asking me, right?

36:25.315 --> 36:26.595
Then I'm moved.

36:26.875 --> 36:28.771
I dare not to be not moved.

36:28.795 --> 36:31.835
You're so... How can you be like this?

36:31.835 --> 36:32.636
A glib talker.

36:32.636 --> 36:34.315
You really have a gift of the gab.
Who did you learn it from?

36:34.315 --> 36:35.595
From you.

36:37.355 --> 36:39.255
When have I been like this?

36:39.795 --> 36:41.235
You've always been like this.

36:41.235 --> 36:42.585
You are not wronged.

36:42.585 --> 36:43.865
Granny said

36:44.355 --> 36:45.315
when you were in junior high school,

36:45.315 --> 36:47.695
you took the girls home for dinner.

36:48.315 --> 36:49.385
Nonsense.

36:49.385 --> 36:51.635
When did I take the girls home for dinner?

36:51.635 --> 36:53.979
It's said that she ate at
yours for more than a month.

36:55.945 --> 36:57.835
You did remind me of it.

36:57.835 --> 37:00.105
She's a classmate sitting in front of me.

37:00.105 --> 37:02.945
At that time, her parents
went downtown for surgery,

37:02.945 --> 37:04.425
so there was no one at
home, and she was on her own.

37:04.425 --> 37:07.741
Therefore, I took her home by the
way and let her have dinner with us.

37:08.905 --> 37:10.205
How kind-hearted.

37:10.315 --> 37:10.946
Of course, I am.

37:10.946 --> 37:13.651
I used to be the vice monitor of our class.

37:13.675 --> 37:14.905
Prestigious.

37:14.905 --> 37:16.275
Indeed.

37:16.275 --> 37:17.555
And you?

37:19.235 --> 37:23.025
I was the assistant
of our English teacher.

37:23.025 --> 37:24.315
I'm not talking about this.

37:24.315 --> 37:27.635
I'm asking, did you bring
a boy home for dinner?

37:27.635 --> 37:29.355
Surely not.

37:30.105 --> 37:32.715
If I had taken the boys home for dinner,

37:32.715 --> 37:34.881
my mother would have crippled me.

37:34.905 --> 37:36.945
I'm not talking about when you were in school.

37:36.945 --> 37:42.893
I'm asking, did you bring your
love of life home for dinner?

37:46.465 --> 37:47.745
Yes.

37:49.945 --> 37:51.875
When my grandmother passed away,

37:51.875 --> 37:53.905
my love of life asked for leave
to accompany me home,

37:53.905 --> 37:55.795
helping me with everything about the funeral,

37:55.795 --> 37:57.815
so my family liked her a lot.

37:57.875 --> 37:59.155
Just

37:59.465 --> 38:02.013
a very, very likable person.

38:03.715 --> 38:05.105
Is that person that good?

38:05.105 --> 38:06.385
Yes.

38:06.505 --> 38:08.141
Couldn't be better.

38:08.195 --> 38:09.945
I can't explain it with a word or two.

38:09.945 --> 38:11.425
I need to

38:11.755 --> 38:14.481
start with the time when we went to college.

38:14.505 --> 38:16.905
You went to the same college together?

38:16.905 --> 38:20.245
Then you've known each other
for more than 10 years.

38:21.025 --> 38:24.401
I was in the same class
with Chen Nanxing in college.

38:24.425 --> 38:25.195
Chen... what?

38:25.195 --> 38:26.275
Chen Nanxing.

38:26.275 --> 38:27.555
C-H-E-N Chen.

38:27.835 --> 38:29.755
X-I-N-G Xing. Just like the star.
(Xing means stars in Chinese)

38:29.755 --> 38:31.511
The one and only star.

38:31.795 --> 38:34.427
The one and only star.

38:34.795 --> 38:38.531
Let bygones be bygones.

38:42.025 --> 38:43.685
I almost let it go now.

38:43.835 --> 38:45.115
You see.

38:45.355 --> 38:49.795
I can now talk about her with
you while eating sweet potatoes.

38:49.795 --> 38:51.455
I can't do this before.

38:52.795 --> 38:54.075
It's like

38:55.025 --> 38:57.853
a cactus thorn in your flesh.

38:59.835 --> 39:02.335
It doesn't affect you to do anything,

39:03.675 --> 39:05.935
but it has such a strong presence

39:08.425 --> 39:10.001
that it'll remind you

39:10.315 --> 39:16.595
that it's right there whatever you do.

39:18.755 --> 39:20.895
Do you know what it feels like?

39:24.715 --> 39:26.255
I guess I can get you

39:26.585 --> 39:28.545
after you made this analogy.

39:29.025 --> 39:32.137
On one occasion I went to pick cactus fruit,

39:32.275 --> 39:34.427
a thorn stuck in my palm.

39:34.465 --> 39:35.355
Whenever I touch it, it hurt.

39:35.355 --> 39:38.355
Although it hurt, I couldn't take
it out no matter how hard I tried.

39:38.355 --> 39:39.635
But in the end

39:39.715 --> 39:41.635
the wound would recover certainly,

39:41.635 --> 39:47.385
or it would fester and become
inflamed, or it would suddenly disappear

39:47.385 --> 39:49.045
before you realized it.

39:53.795 --> 39:55.371
Sometimes I think

39:57.235 --> 40:01.115
it's good to just leave it there.

40:05.315 --> 40:08.319
I know how you feel,
refusing to let it go.

40:09.425 --> 40:10.705
However,

40:11.875 --> 40:13.355
there're many things

40:13.465 --> 40:15.965
that we can't even control ourselves,

40:16.635 --> 40:17.935
let alone others.

40:28.675 --> 40:31.247
In fact, people around us come and go.

40:32.385 --> 40:38.749
Most people can only walk with
you for a short period of time.

40:38.795 --> 40:42.723
They'll keep leaving on the way.

40:45.585 --> 40:47.605
Isn't this what life is like?

41:08.275 --> 41:10.379
The rain is never-ending.

41:23.095 --> 41:26.615
♫ I've been alone ♫

41:26.615 --> 41:30.175
♫ into the unknown. ♫

41:30.175 --> 41:33.615
♫ Can navigate ♫

41:33.615 --> 41:37.335
♫ through the dark. ♫

41:37.335 --> 41:41.175
♫ I'm searching for ♫

41:41.175 --> 41:44.675
♫ a meadow of mine ♫

41:44.675 --> 41:51.185
♫ till you came in with the breeze. ♫

41:51.185 --> 41:54.237
♫ A feeling rushing out to me ♫

41:54.375 --> 41:59.455
♫ spills my heart into the field ♫

41:59.935 --> 42:06.455
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

42:07.375 --> 42:13.271
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

42:14.775 --> 42:21.175
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

42:21.175 --> 42:27.551
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

42:29.495 --> 42:35.919
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

42:36.855 --> 42:42.655
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

42:44.295 --> 42:50.815
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

42:50.815 --> 42:58.199
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

42:59.095 --> 43:05.535
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

43:05.535 --> 43:13.535
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

43:13.695 --> 43:15.735
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

43:15.735 --> 43:20.375
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

43:20.375 --> 43:28.679
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

